OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to evacuate 1,300 households
OL,4,Aover WW2 bomb
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cordon is expected to be expanded to
OL,7,Fallow experts to deal with a suspected
OL,8,Funexploded bomb found in a town.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,FFalmouth Docks at 09:15 BST on Monday
OL,12,Fafter a suspected 250lb (115kg)
OL,13,FAmerican World War Two air-dropped
OL,14,Fdevice was found in the water.
OL,16,FA 300m (984ft) exclusion zone is in
OL,17,Fplace, with Cornwall Council saying it
OL,18,Fwas "expected to expand" to 1,400m
OL,19,F(4593ft) on Wednesday - with the
OL,20,Fpossible evacuation of up to 1,309
OL,21,Fhouseholds.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
