OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to evacuate 1,300 households
OL,4,Aover WW2 bomb
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuperintendent Ian Thompson from Devon
OL,7,Fand Cornwall Police said the expansion
OL,8,Fplans followed advice from military
OL,9,Fbomb disposal experts and was
OL,10,F"essential so these specialists can
OL,11,Fproceed safely with the next stage of
OL,12,Ftheir work".
